Derived from libopencm3 and libopenwch
--------------------------------------

`Makefile` is derived from libopencm3's application makefiles
(LGPL-3.0-or-later), via libopencm3-template's `rules.mk`, and follows
libopenwch's adaptations of them for RISC-V, generic `riscv64-unknown-elf`
toolchains and genlink-based linker script generation.

  libopencm3        https://github.com/libopencm3/libopencm3     LGPL-3.0+
  libopenwch        https://github.com/LrkSeraph/libopenwch      LGPL-3.0+
  libopencm3-template
                    https://github.com/bonedaddy/libopencm3-template
                    the model for the PROJECT/DEVICE/OPENWCH_DIR layout

libopenwch itself contains no code from WCH's SDK; its Bluetooth LE layer links
a closed-source stack that is Apache-2.0.  That boundary is described in
libopenwch's own NOTICE, and only matters to a project that sets
`LIBOPENWCH_BLE=1`.

